[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_8_MISCS_TO]
> Enter Other Venues

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_8_MISCS_TO_desc]
Other venues include exhibition areas from various countries around the world, such as the Ornithia Kingdom, Dominion of Stratusburg, and Klugetown, etc.

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_8_MISCS_TO]
> 前往其他会场

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_8_MISCS_TO_desc]
其他会场包括来自世界各地国家的展区，例如奥尼西亚王国、层云堡自治领、克鲁格镇等。
